
Cloud computing means using computing resources over the internet instead of maintaining physical infrastructure yourself.

Why Cloud?

Traditional setup:

Buy physical servers
Maintain hardware
Pay for infrastructure even when unused
Scaling is difficult

With cloud:

Resources are available on demand
Easy to scale
Pay for what you use
Infrastructure is managed through cloud providers
AWS

AWS (Amazon Web Services) is a cloud platform that provides services such as:

Compute
Storage
Databases
Networking
Security
Containers
